[[{"t":"比丘尼羯磨經劉宋 求那跋摩譯","level":0},{"t":"比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />羯磨法結界法第一結界法第一注曰其諸結界羯磨作法一與上大僧同唯稱<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />大姉為異。受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />法第二受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />法第二比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />乞畜眾羯磨　注曰若比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />欲度","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"人者當往比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />僧中偏露右肩脫革屣禮僧足已右膝著地合掌乞畜眾羯磨作如是白　大姉僧聽我比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今從僧乞度人授具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />願僧聽我","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"度人授人授具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　注曰如是三說　與畜眾羯磨文　大德僧聽此比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今從僧乞度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />若僧時到僧忍聽僧今聽比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />白如是　大姉僧聽此比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今從僧乞度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />僧今聽比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />誰諸大姉忍僧聽比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />者嘿然誰不忍者說僧已忍聽比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />竟僧忍嘿然故是事如是持度沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />文　注曰若在寺內剃髮者應白一切僧","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"若不和合應房房語令知若和合應作白然後與剃髮應作如是言　大姉僧聽此某甲欲從某甲求剃髮若僧時到僧忍聽為某甲剃髮白如是　注曰白","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"已為剃髮欲在寺內出家者應白一切僧若不和合應房房令知若和合應作白然後與出家應作如是白　大姉僧聽此某甲欲從某甲求出家若僧時到","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"僧忍聽與某甲出家白如是　注曰應作如是出家教出家者著袈裟已偏露右肩脫革屣右膝著地合掌教作如是言　我阿姨某甲歸依佛歸依法歸依","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"僧我今隨佛出家和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲如來无所著等正覺是我世尊　注曰如是三說　我阿姨某甲歸依佛竟歸依法竟歸依僧竟我今隨佛出家竟和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"甲如來无所著等正覺是我世尊　注曰如是三說　說如是已應與受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　盡形壽不得煞生是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得偷盜是","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得婬欲是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得妄語是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"壽不得飲酒是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得著華󳌃香塗身是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得歌儛唱伎及往觀聽","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"（比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />羯磨經第一石背）是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得高廣大牀上坐是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得非時食","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　盡形壽不得捉持生像金銀寶物是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　如是沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />十<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />盡形壽不得犯能持不","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"注曰荅言能　汝已受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />竟當供養三寶佛寶法寶僧寶當脩三業坐禪誦經勸助眾事　注曰聽童女十八者二年學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />年滿二十二部僧中受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />若年","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"十󷠸曾出適者聽二年學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />年滿十二與受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />應如是與二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />受六法文　注曰沙󳇐應往比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />眾中偏露右肩脫革屣禮比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />僧","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"足已右膝著地合掌白如是言　大姉僧聽我沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今從僧乞二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲願僧濟度我慈愍故與我二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　注曰如是三說應將沙","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />至離聞處著見處眾中應著堪能作羯磨者如上應作白言　大姉僧聽此某甲沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />今從僧乞二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲若僧時到僧忍聽僧今與某","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"甲沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲白如是　大姉僧聽此某甲沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />今從僧乞二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲僧今與某甲沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲誰諸大","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"姉忍僧與某甲沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲者嘿然誰不忍者說是初羯磨　注曰如是三說　僧已忍與某甲沙󳇐<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二󷠸學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲竟僧忍嘿","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"然故是事如是持　注曰應如是與六法　某甲諦聽如來无所著等正覺說六法不得犯不淨行行婬欲法若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />行婬欲法非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非釋種女","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"與染汙心男子共身相摩觸<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />應更與受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中盡形壽不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得偷盜乃至草葉若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />取人五錢若過五錢若自取","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"教人取若自斫教人斫若自破教人破若燒若埋若壞色非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非釋種女若取减五錢<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />應更與受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中盡形壽不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"不得故断眾生命乃至蟻子若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />故自手断人命求刀授與人教死勸死讚死與人非藥墮胎厭禱呪術自作教人作者非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非釋種女若断","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"畜生不能變化者命<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />應更與受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中盡形壽不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得妄語乃至戲<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01510.gif\" alt=\"𭉋\" title=\"𭉋\" />若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />不真實非己有自稱言得上人法言","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"得禪得解脫得三昧正受得湏陁洹果斯陁含果阿<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />含果阿羅漢果言天來龍來鬼神來供養我此非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非釋種女若於眾中故作妄語<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" />應更與","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中盡形壽不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得非時食若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非時食犯<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />應更與受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中盡形壽不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"飲酒若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />飲酒犯<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />應更與受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中盡形壽不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />於一切<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />中應學除為比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />過食自受食食","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />法　注曰若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />學<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />已年滿廿若滿十二應與受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />先至比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />僧中請和上應如是說言　大姉一心念我某甲求阿姨為和","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"上願阿姨為我作和上我依阿姨故得受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　注曰如是三說和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />應荅言　尓　注曰應如是受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />人離聞處著見處應差教授師是<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />師應如是問","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"言　此眾中誰能為某甲作教授師　注曰若有者荅言我能尓時<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />師即應作白　大姉僧聽此某甲從和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲求受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />若僧時到僧忍聽某甲為","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"教授師白如是　注曰教授師應往至受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />人所語言　此安陁會欝多羅僧僧伽梨此僧竭<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00832.gif\" alt=\"䨱\" title=\"䨱\" />肩衣此衣鉢是汝有不　注曰荅言有　善女人諦聽今是","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"真誠時我今問汝有便言有无當言无汝不犯邊罪不汝不犯淨行比丘不汝不賊心受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />不汝不破內外道不汝非黃門不汝不煞父不汝不煞母不汝不","level":0,"quote":true},{"t":"煞真人阿羅漢不汝不破僧不汝不<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/08/CB08891.gif\" alt=\"𢙣\" title=\"𢙣\" />心出佛身血不汝非非人不汝非畜生不汝非二根不汝字何等和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />字誰年󷠸滿未衣鉢具足不父母夫主聽汝","level":0,"quote":true}